{"lessonId":26,"version":"d38e6ece3705","questions":[{"kind":"word-form-choice","sourceId":"v1:part5:26:10","wordId":"collaboration-26","prompt":"The data entry clerk is so accustomed to working by herself that I really doubt if she is capable of ________ on this project.","answer":"collaborating","options":["collaborated","collaborating","collaborator","collaborates"],"sourceVersion":"d38e6ece3705"},{"kind":"word-form-choice","sourceId":"v1:part5:26:11","wordId":"concentrate-26","prompt":"Sue always ________ so hard on her work that she forgets where she is.","answer":"concentrates","options":["concentrated","concentrates","concentration","concentrating"],"sourceVersion":"d38e6ece3705"},{"kind":"word-form-choice","sourceId":"v1:part5:26:12","wordId":"disruption-26","prompt":"The constant flow of traffic by the researcher's desk proved to be very ________","answer":"disruptive","options":["disruptive","disrupts","disruption","disrupted"],"sourceVersion":"d38e6ece3705"},{"kind":"word-form-choice","sourceId":"v1:part5:26:13","wordId":"inconsiderately-26","prompt":"The employee lounge is for everyone's enjoyment so please don't use it ________","answer":"inconsiderately","options":["inconsiderate","inconsiderateness","inconsiderately","inconsideration"],"sourceVersion":"d38e6ece3705"},{"kind":"word-form-choice","sourceId":"v1:part5:26:14","wordId":"opt-26","prompt":"Some people always ________ for the easy way out.","answer":"opt","options":["opt","option","optional","options"],"sourceVersion":"d38e6ece3705"},{"kind":"word-form-choice","sourceId":"v1:part5:26:15","wordId":"scrutiny-26","prompt":"After close ________ of the options, the managers chose an advertising company to do ail the publicity for the new campaign.","answer":"scrutiny","options":["scrutinize","scrutinizing","scrutiny","scrutable"],"sourceVersion":"d38e6ece3705"},{"kind":"cloze-choice","sourceId":"catalog:example:collaboration-26:1","wordId":"collaboration-26","prompt":"We believe that it was our ________ that enabled us to achieve such favorable results.","answer":"collaboration","options":["collaboration","disruption","lobby","scrutiny"],"sourceVersion":"d38e6ece3705"},{"kind":"cloze-choice","sourceId":"catalog:example:concentrate-26:0","wordId":"concentrate-26","prompt":"In his quiet, corner office, the manager could finally ________ and finish his work.","answer":"concentrate","options":["concentrate","hamper","move up","opt"],"sourceVersion":"d38e6ece3705"},{"kind":"cloze-choice","sourceId":"catalog:example:disruption-26:1","wordId":"disruption-26","prompt":"The strike caused a ________ in production at the factory.","answer":"disruption","options":["disruption","collaboration","lobby","scrutiny"],"sourceVersion":"d38e6ece3705"},{"kind":"cloze-choice","sourceId":"catalog:example:lobby-26:0","wordId":"lobby-26","prompt":"The salesperson waited in the busy ________ for the buyer to see him.","answer":"lobby","options":["lobby","collaboration","disruption","scrutiny"],"sourceVersion":"d38e6ece3705"},{"kind":"cloze-choice","sourceId":"catalog:example:move-up-26:1","wordId":"move-up-26","prompt":"In order to ________ in the company, employees had to demonstrate their loyalty.","answer":"move up","options":["move up","concentrate","hamper","opt"],"sourceVersion":"d38e6ece3705"},{"kind":"cloze-choice","sourceId":"catalog:example:scrutiny-26:0","wordId":"scrutiny-26","prompt":"After a great deal of ________, the manager decided that the employee's work had improved considerably.","answer":"scrutiny","options":["scrutiny","collaboration","disruption","lobby"],"sourceVersion":"d38e6ece3705"}]}
